# Sponsors

- Sponsors are org-scoped; seed Hashtag India Cary (Starks) and CGI (Steelers).
- Status workflow: `draft` → `pending_approval` → `approved` | `rejected` | `archived`.
- Public pages and iOS only show `approved` sponsors (and active campaigns).
- Uploads go to Storage under `{organization_id}/{sponsor_id}/...` with admin approval.
- Record `sponsor_impression` / `sponsor_click` analytics events with `organization_id` and source (`web` | `ios`).
- Shareable path: `/sponsors/[slug]` on the club hostname.
